Hand-written revert of 8c9f44b6 against the current tree: a Group or Sequence member that
settled Excluded counts as failed for the Tasks After its container again (tally.go stops
folding it into the container's success), and a Task a failed predecessor keeps from running
settles with the bare "not started" summary instead of naming the stopper. Later edits to
internal/project/present/ports.go keep the commit's own hunks from reversing, so this removes
the two graph behaviours both guarding tests depend on.

